#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0017 expect=noViolation domain=AEX
# Rule:Description: Raise an error when a split dataset (excluding Supplemental Qualifier, Related Records, and Associated Persons datasets) has a name whose length is not 3 or 4 characters.
#note "Split dataset name AEX is 3 characters (within 3-4) -> no violation"
dataset AEX label="Adverse Events (split)"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | AE | 01-701-1015
CDISCPILOT01 | AE | 01-701-1023
---
